Package: qt6-tools
Version: @DEB_QTTOOLS_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Libraries
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://www.qt.io/
Depends: qt6-base
Description: Minimal Qt 6 tools libraries for the Xios desktop
